{"id":44673,"brand_id":228,"unique_id":"AOiVN7bw0YCifud4","content_key":"/p/give","identifies_id":228,"identifies_type":"Brand","title":"How do I give?","data":{"blocks":[{"col_1":[{"type":"text","uuid":"3b7f1019-3d7a-4557-bbe9-7f1d97b8a991","content":"\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eHow do I give on Give Miami Day?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e"}],"layout":"block_1","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"backgrounds":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/0b309300-1356-428b-9d4d-0742fd364fcc/","uuid":"0b309300-1356-428b-9d4d-0742fd364fcc"}],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"image","background_color":"#6a3ebd","background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0.68},{"col_1":[{"type":"text","uuid":"1f9a1db9-86ee-41c1-8dd9-5c41449ef636","content":"\u003cp\u003eGive Miami Day is your chance to show up for the Miami you love. Your gift can go to the food pantry down the street, the shelter where you adopted your dog, or a cause you\u0026rsquo;re just starting to care about. The choice is yours. With \u003cstrong\u003emore than 1,000 nonprofits \u003c/strong\u003etaking part, there\u0026rsquo;s so much good to discover. Below, you\u0026rsquo;ll find simple instructions on how to give, plus a few tools to help you explore and find the causes that matter most to you.\u003c/p\u003e"},[{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/search?discoveryAssistant=true\u0026sid=f3f239ba\u0026orgScope=on","fill":true,"size":"medium","type":"button","uuid":"264cc032-0c8f-4abb-8437-8ca9a93ea041","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","invert":false,"content":"Discovery Assistant","new_tab":false,"position":"center"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/search?sid=39ae53af\u0026orgScope=on\u0026giveAgainDialog=true","fill":true,"size":"medium","type":"button","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","invert":false,"content":"Give Again","new_tab":false,"position":"center"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/categorydescriptions","fill":true,"size":"medium","type":"button","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","invert":false,"content":"By Issue Area","new_tab":false,"position":"center"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/search?orgScope=on\u0026matchingGrantsOnly=on","fill":true,"size":"medium","type":"button","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","invert":false,"content":"Look for Matches","new_tab":false,"position":"center"},{"url":"/p/DonorFaq","fill":true,"size":"medium","type":"button","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","invert":false,"content":"FAQ","new_tab":false,"position":"center"}]],"layout":"block_1","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"type":"text","uuid":"99ff17d1-00fe-4209-b927-26dfe5244670","content":"\u003ch1 data-pasted=\"true\"\u003eGive Miami Day in \u003cstrong\u003e3 Easy Steps\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you live in or simply love Greater Miami, you have the power to make a difference in our community. Explore the nonprofits and issue areas that need your support. 🗺️\u003c/p\u003e"},{"type":"text","uuid":"c675f62e-d14c-4008-b78c-f95fc3f2b65f","content":"\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChoose\u003c/strong\u003e which organization(s) you want to give to. You can use the exploration tools on this page to find an organization.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdd\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eyour donation(s) to your cart.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDon\u0026#39;t forget to check out\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ewhen you\u0026#39;re done exploring organizations.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e"}],"col_2":[{"src":"https://youtube.com/shorts/0WHEdcUx1Uw","type":"video","uuid":"ff88